@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Boast and cross-court
Boast and cross-court, five minutes. Start in the back right corner. Boast so the ball reaches the
front left, run after it, and drive it firmly cross-court, just above the service line on the left
half of the front wall, into the back right corner. Then boast again and keep the loop going. The
boast is a feed, soft enough to reach; the cross-court is the shot. Switch sides halfway. Restart
with a hand feed whenever it breaks down.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 5:00
0:00 [go]
8% Width: hit the side wall behind the service box.
22% Get in front of the ball. Rotate through it.
36% Boast soft enough to reach. The cross-court is the shot.
50% Switch. Boast from the back left, cross-court from the front right, aiming right of centre.
64% Width again. The side wall behind the service box.
78% Wide enough to pass someone standing on the T.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
